# A row turns to its other arm in place, with its event wired.
click #on1
click #off1
# The rows move with whichever node they show, the empty one too.
click #reverse
# A row turns to the empty arm's sibling, and back, after the move.
click #off2
click #bump
click #on4
# A row leaves, with its node; a new one comes.
click #drop
click #add
click #on5
